# ---- the rim, seen from above ----
# Only the outer 3px ring is ever drawn (the four rim pieces each take one edge of it); the middle
# 10x10 is the pot's mouth, which the model fills with block/infuser_inner and the brew. The ring is
# bevelled — lit on the outside edge, shaded on the inside — so the rim reads as a lip with
# thickness rather than a painted border.
@texture block/infuser_top 16x16 type=block
